.Dd October 8, 2026
.Dt MANET-PROVISION-STATUS.SH 8
.Os MANET
.Sh NAME
.Nm manet-provision-status.sh
.Nd display provisioning progress and operator-script results
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the recorded provisioning state: running, incomplete or complete.
Incomplete runs include failed steps and retry instructions.
Completed runs show the installed version and time since completion.
Staged operator-script results are shown alongside the verdict when available.
.Pp
The command takes no options and is also run by the SSH login banner.
If neither recorded state nor a completion marker exists, it prints nothing.
It reports recorded setup results; it does not test current mesh connectivity.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /var/lib/manet-provision.state
Provisioning state and timing.
.It Pa /var/lib/manet-provision.failures
Failed setup steps; at most eight are displayed.
.It Pa /var/lib/radio-setup.done
Completion marker, whose modification time supplies the completion time.
.It Pa /etc/manet_version.txt
Installed version.
.It Pa /var/lib/manet-user-scripts/
Staged operator scripts.
.It Pa /var/lib/manet-user-scripts.state , /var/lib/manet-user-scripts.done
Recorded operator-script results and completion marker.
.It Pa /var/log/radio-setup.log , /var/log/manet-user-scripts.log
Detailed logs named by the status output.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Exits 0 regardless of the recorded provisioning verdict.
Read the output to determine whether setup completed.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr manet-user-scripts.sh 8 ,
.Xr radio-setup.sh 8 ,
.Xr verify-bridge.sh 8
